hifiberry-audiocontrol (0.8.4) trixie; urgency=medium

  * auth manifest: classify POST /library/*/update as "ok". Rescanning the
    music library is an everyday music action, not a system change; it was
    falling through to the risky default and 401'd from the Music Files page.

